ent-CMUBadBloodCampRule = Bad Blood Clan
    .desc = Tracks the Bad Blood clan, its Lodge and its Superiority Points.

ent-CMUBadBloodCamp = Bad Blood Lodge
    .desc = A throne of bone and scavenged plating, hung with the clan's trophies. The clan does not outlast it for long.
    .suffix = Bad Blood

ent-CMUBadBloodCampKit = Lodge kit
    .desc = Bone poles, hide and plating, bundled for carrying. Only the clan's Leader knows how it goes together.
    .suffix = Bad Blood

ent-CMUYautjaBadBloodLeaderBracer = clan leader's bracer
    .desc = A scavenged hunting bracer wound with the clan's kill-cords. Whoever leads the Bad Bloods wears it.

ent-CMUActionBadBloodPitchCamp = Pitch Camp
    .desc = Ready a Lodge kit. Use the kit on open ground, away from the prey's landing zones, to raise the clan's Lodge.

ent-CMUBadBloodCampSpit = Lodge spit
    .desc = A fire pit under an iron spit, big enough to turn a whole carcass.
    .suffix = Bad Blood

ent-CMUBadBloodCampAscensionStone = Ascension Stone
    .desc = A slab cut with the marks of every Leader the clan has followed. Whoever would be the next one stands here.
    .suffix = Bad Blood

ent-CMUBadBloodCampArmory = Lodge armory
    .desc = A scavenged forge and the racks around it. The clan arms itself here with what its kills have earned.
    .suffix = Bad Blood

ent-CMUBadBloodCampKennel = Lodge kennel
    .desc = A slatted livestock crate dragged out of the prey's colony, its bars gnawed from the inside. The clan's hounds sleep here until they are called.
    .suffix = Bad Blood

ent-CMUBadBloodCampCauldron = Lodge cauldron
    .desc = A black pot kept at a rolling boil. It strips a severed limb down to clean bone.
    .suffix = Bad Blood

cmu-bad-blood-camp-kit-leader-only = Only the clan's Leader can raise the Lodge.
cmu-bad-blood-camp-kit-ready = You bundle a Lodge kit. Use it on open ground to raise the Lodge.
cmu-bad-blood-camp-already-standing = The clan's Lodge already stands.
cmu-bad-blood-camp-cooldown = The clan is not ready to raise another Lodge. Wait { $seconds } more seconds.
cmu-bad-blood-camp-roofed = The Lodge needs open sky. You cannot raise it under a roof.
cmu-bad-blood-camp-near-landing-zone = This is too close to the prey's landing zone to raise the Lodge.
cmu-bad-blood-camp-pitched-first = The Lodge stands. Bring it trophies and prey. The clan may raise one Clan Totem for free.
cmu-bad-blood-camp-pitched = The Lodge stands again.
cmu-bad-blood-camp-under-attack = The Lodge is under attack!
cmu-bad-blood-camp-destroyed = The Lodge has fallen! Only the Leader can raise another.
